{
  "id": "1CO.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "1CO",
  "reference": "1 Corinthians 1",
  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paul, called ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " an apostle of Jesus Christ through the will of God, and Sosthenes our brother, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unto the church of God which is at Corinth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " them that are sanctified in Christ Jesus, called ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " saints, with all that call upon the name of our Lord Jesus Christ in every place, their ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and ours: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Grace to you and peace from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I thank my God always concerning you, for the grace of God which was given you in Christ Jesus; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that in everything ye were enriched in him, in all utterance and all knowledge; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "even as the testimony of Christ was confirmed in you: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "so that ye come behind in no gift; waiting for the revelation of our Lord Jesus Christ; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "who shall also confirm you unto the end, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " unreproveable in the day of our Lord Jesus Christ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God is faithful, through whom ye were called into the fellowship of his Son Jesus Christ our Lord.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now I beseech you, brethren, through the name of our Lord Jesus Christ, that ye all speak the same thing, and ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " there be no divisions among you; but ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ye be perfected together in the same mind and in the same judgment. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For it hath been signified unto me concerning you, my brethren, by them ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of Chloe, that there are contentions among you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now this I mean, that each one of you saith, I am of Paul; and I of Apollos; and I of Cephas; and I of Christ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Is Christ divided? was Paul crucified for you? or were ye baptized into the name of Paul? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I thank God that I baptized none of you, save Crispus and Gaius; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lest any man should say that ye were baptized into my name. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I baptized also the household of Stephanas: besides, I know not whether I baptized any other. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For Christ sent me not to baptize, but to preach the gospel: not in wisdom of words, lest the cross of Christ should be made void.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the word of the cross is to them that perish foolishness; but unto us who are saved it is the power of God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For it is written,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For behold your calling, brethren, that not many wise after the flesh, not many mighty, not many noble, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but God chose the foolish things of the world, that he might put to shame them that are wise; and God chose the weak things of the world, that he might put to shame the things that are strong; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the base things of the world, and the things that are despised, did God choose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and the things that are not, that he might bring to nought the things that are: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that no flesh should glory before God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But of him are ye in Christ Jesus, who was made unto us wisdom from God, and righteousness and sanctification, and redemption: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that, according as it is written, He that glorieth, let him glory in the Lord.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "1CO.2",
    "number": "2",
